       "headline": "Advertising revenue, which remains the company’s economic backbone, rose to $55.02 billion in the quarter, accounting for the vast majority of total revenue of $56.31 billion, up 33 percent from a year earlier. Net income surged 61 percent to $26.77 billion, aided in part by a significant tax benefit, while operating income rose 30 percent to $22.87 billion.",
